<h1>About Gift of the Givers</h1>

<p>
    The Gift of the Givers Foundation is dedicated to providing swift and effective aid
    to communities affected by natural disasters and emergencies in South Africa and beyond.
    Since our founding, we have operated on the principles of compassion, efficiency, and
    resilience, working alongside volunteers and experts to make a tangible difference in
    the lives of those affected by adversity.
</p>

<h2>Our Mission</h2>
<p>
    To respond rapidly and effectively to disasters, coordinating relief efforts, managing
    donations transparently, and mobilising volunteers where they are needed most.
</p>

<h2>What We Do</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Coordinate emergency relief projects across affected regions</li>
    <li>Manage and track donor contributions, including recurring and once-off support</li>
    <li>Recruit and organise volunteers based on skills and availability</li>
    <li>Provide transparent, real-time updates on ongoing relief efforts</li>
</ul>

<p>
    This platform was built to support that mission — connecting donors, volunteers, and
    Foundation staff on a single, reliable system.
</p>
